   ],
   "content": [
    {
     "body": "The LS_UP level shifter (kind level_shifter) is defined by the subcircuit:\n.subckt LS_UP IN OUT VDDL VDDH VSS\n  XI IN INB VDDL VSS LS_UP_LS_IN\n  XC IN INB OUT VDDH VSS LS_UP_LS_CORE\n.ends\nIt instantiates two internal blocks: LS_UP_LS_IN (custom) and LS_UP_LS_CORE (custom).",
     "heading": "Netlist Overview",
     "status": "derived"
